<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Результат теста</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #6c5ce7;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 0px 0px 0px;
            width: 95%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #512da8 0%, #03000c 100%);
        }

        .result-page {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        .result-title {
            font-size: 28px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            color: black;
        }

        .profession-image {
            width: 200px;
            height: 200px;
            margin: 0 auto 30px;
            background-color: #fff;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

            .profession-image img {
                max-width: 90%;
                max-height: 90%;
            }

        .result-buttons {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 15px;
            max-width: 400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .result-btn {
            background-color: #2ecc71;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            font-size: 16px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.3s;
        }

            .result-btn:hover {
                background-color: #27ae60;
            }

            .result-btn.secondary {
                background-color: #3498db;
            }

                .result-btn.secondary:hover {
                    background-color: #2980b9;
                }

        @@media (max-width: 768px) {
            .container_prof

        {
            padding: 15px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 26px;
        }

        .description p {
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .result-buttons {
            max-width: 100%;
        }

        }
    </style>
</head>

<body style="width: 95%;">

    <nav class="nav-bar">
        <ul>
            <li><a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index" class="nav-item">Главная</a></li>
            <li><a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="RAEX" class="nav-item">Рейтинг по REAX</a></li>
            <li><a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Prof" class="nav-item">Профориентация</a></li>
            <li><a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Calc" class="nav-item">Калькулятор ЕГЭ</a></li>
            <li><a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Guide" class="nav-item">Гайды</a></li>
            <li><a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Open_doors" class="nav-item">Дни открытых дверей</a></li>
            <li><a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Kabinet" class="nav-item">Личный кабинет</a></li>
            <li><a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index_rabota" class="nav-item">Для работодателей</a></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>
    <div>
        <div id="result-page" class="result-page">
            <div class="result-title">Вам подходит профессия - <strong>Врач-Ветеринар</strong></div>

            <div class="profession-image">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <circle cx="50" cy="30" r="20" fill="#E0E0E0" />
                    <path d="M30 100V60C30 50 70 50 70 60V100H30Z" fill="#FFFFFF" />
                    <rect x="45" y="70" width="10" height="30" fill="#E0E0E0" />
                    <path d="M30 60V65H70V60C70 50 30 50 30 60Z" fill="#4CAF50" />
                    <circle cx="40" cy="25" r="3" fill="#333333" />
                    <circle cx="60" cy="25" r="3" fill="#333333" />
                    <path d="M43 35C45 38 55 38 57 35" stroke="#333333" stroke-width="2" />
                    <path d="M35 45C35 45 45 55 65 45" stroke="#4CAF50" stroke-width="2" />
                    <circle cx="65" cy="45" r="4" fill="#4CAF50" />
                    <rect x="40" y="55" width="20" height="3" fill="#FF5722" />
                    <rect x="48" y="15" width="4" height="10" fill="#FFFFFF" />
                    <rect x="45" y="18" width="10" height="4" fill="#FFFFFF" />
                </svg>
            </div>

            <div class="result-buttons">
                <button class="result-btn">Ознакомиться с полным результатом тестирования</button>
                <button class="result-btn secondary">Посмотреть лучшие учебные заведения по профилю</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
